  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b7f5be794788a86acd2c2c7c7a97c1347686e1ce807c6c29a7f28dcde0668976.png] \n\nThe given equation is: **8 + 6 × 4 - 3 ÷ 1 = 2**\n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **+ and -, 6 and 3**\n\n→ 8 - 3 × 4 + **6 ÷ 1** = 2\n\n→ 8 - **3**** × 4** + 6 = 2\n\n→ **8** - 12 **+ 6** = 2\n\n→ 14 - 12 = 2\n\n→ 2 = 2\n\n→ **LHS = RHS** ⇒ **Justifies the statement.**\n\n2) **×**** and ÷, 8 and 3**\n\n→ 3 + **6 ÷ 4** - 8 × 1 = 2\n\n→ 3 + 3/2 - **8**** ×**** 1** = 2\n\n→ **3 + 3/2** - 8 = 2\n\n→ 4.5 - 8 = 2\n\n→ - 3.5 ≠ 2\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) **×**** and ÷, 6 and 3**\n\n→ 8 + **3 ÷ 4** - 6 × 1 = 2\n\n→ 8 + 3/4 - **6**** ×**** 1** = 2 \n\n→ **8 + 3/4** - 6 = 2\n\n→ 35/4 - 6 = 2\n\n→ 11/4 ≠ 2\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) **+ and ****÷, 1 and 8**\n\n→ **1**** ÷ 6** × 4 - 3 + 8 = 2\n\n→ **1/6 × 4** - 3 + 8 = 2\n\n→ **2/3** - 3 **+**** 8** = 2\n\n→ 26/3 - 3 = 2\n\n→ 17/3 ≠ 2\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 1 justifies the statement.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"+ and -, 6 and 3\"**.",
